<urn:atm:triage:finding/RBQA-F001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RBQA-F001" ;
  triage:title "Dead code in normalize_worker path with stale AI.48 label" ;
  triage:description "normalize_worker() and its helpers (_default_input(), _default_finding()) are dead code left over from the pre-v2 ('AI.48') report path. Since normalize_campaign() now delegates exclusively to run_fuzz.validate_report() and projects results through _v2_worker_for_panel(), normalize_worker() is never called anywhere in the tree. The dead path still carries a stale, wrong provenance label ('AI.48 bounded {worker}campaign') that predates and does not match this sprint's identifiers." ;
